.. note::

   For signing-workflow notifications, subscribe to native LibreSign
   events through Nextcloud Webhook Listeners. Events represent persisted
   business transitions and deliver JSON metadata without signed PDFs.
   See :doc:`../webhooks/event-catalog` for the available classes,
   :doc:`../webhooks/configuration` for subscription setup, and
   :doc:`../webhooks/external-signing-flow` for document recovery.
